    "directions": [
      "In a small bowl, add curd, turmeric powder, degi red chilli powder, and a pinch of asafoetida.",
      "Add gram flour, salt to taste and mix it well. Make sure there’s no lumps.",
      "Add oil and mix it well.",
      "Switch on the steamer, and also grease the mould or the plate then pour the batter in it and steam it for 10-12 minutes on high heat.",
      "Once steamed, remove and let it cool a little, then cut in the desired shape and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add curd, ghee, salt to taste, green chilli, ginger, turmeric powder, degi red chilli powder.",
      "Add a pinch of asafoetida, coriander powder, gram flour and mix everything well.",
      "Keep aside for further use.",
      "In a kadai, add ghee once it’s hot, add fenugreek seeds, cumin seeds, fennel seeds and let it splutter well.",
      "Add dry red chillies, a pinch of asafoetida, add curd mixture and mix it well.",
      "On medium flame keep stirring slowly. Add water and cover it with the lid and cook until one boil.",
      "Stir until the gravy boils properly.",
      "Add prepared besan wadi, cover and cook them on the low flame for 3-4 minutes.",
      "While serving, pour the prepared tadka over the sabji.",
      "Garnish with fresh mint leaves and serve hot with chapati.",
      "Heat oil in a non-stick pan, add carom seeds, onion seeds, white sesame seeds and let it splutter.",
      "Add degi red chilli powder and mix it well. Keep aside for further use."
    ],
